<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-PHILIPPINE T-BILLS SECONDARY MARKET RATES.</title>
<headline>TABLE-PHILIPPINE T-BILLS SECONDARY MARKET RATES.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Thursday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	 6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p> Bank of America    14.45 /14.20  15.00 /14.60  15.25 /14.75</p>
<p> BPI		    14.80 /14.50  15.25 /15.00  15.50 /15.125</p>
<p> Citibank	     15.125/14.75  15.875/15.25  16.50 /15.50</p>
<p> Hongkong Bank	15.25 /14.50  15.50 /14.625 15.75 /14.75</p>
<p> Metrobank	    15.00 /14.10  15.25 /14.625 15.50 /14.875</p>
<p> PNB		    15.00 /14.00  15.75 /14.75  16.25 /15.25</p>
<p> StanChart	    14.75 /14.25  15.25 /14.75  15.50 /15.00</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
